and Mathlib commit `d13f23b723b8a846827a245b89c10fc7d3f11612`.

## Start here

* `DotProduct.paper1_determination` proves `PaperOneDetermination n hħ hm` for spatial
  dimension `n + 1` (spacetime dimension at least two) and positive scales `ħ, m`.
  It identifies the original Schwartz reading law, its exhausting-box limits, the reflected
