## Scope Notes

The names below are relative to `DotProduct`.

* §§2.2–2.3. Copy-rotation symmetry determines the finite Gaussian laws. The finite entropy
  problem determines the scales in its positive-stiffness regime. The measured capstone
  takes those positive scales as inputs. A law is a measure on the Schwartz evaluation
