  Heisenberg evolution of coordinate multiplication on transported finite-particle vectors.
  `Extension.plane_coordinate_domain_iff` identifies its maximal multiplication domain
  with the position field's sector domain. `Extension.measured_plane_heisenberg` treats
  the intersection with the momentum domain.
* §3.3. In namespace `Extension`, `complexNormalRotation_directionalBoost` identifies
  imaginary angle and normal coordinate with the boost of the Poincaré representation.
  `spacelike_vacuum_two_point_heat` identifies the ordered vacuum distribution on
  spacelike-separated compact real tests with the normalized radial heat boundary.
  `spacelike_commutativity_from_heat` deduces field commutativity on the finite-particle core.
* §§3.4–3.6. The composition theorem uses the product of the actual spatial laws. Sharp
